    statement """
        scripts/nested-session.sh stop leaves lege-sessiond and lege-filed running — the pidfiles are there but the processes survive and a stale sessiond keeps holding org.legeos.Session after an apparently clean stop; they had to be killed by hand during the WS3 nested run.
